   "lines": [
    "Kept on up Clear Creek;",
    "camped about six miles",
    "~~before~~ N.W.[?] of the little",
    "town of Buffalo (before reaching",
    "it). Country still treeless,",
    "broken & rolling; many",
    "ranches, some well",
    "built. Have for last",
    "three days been in",
    "sight of the snow streaked",
    "Bighorn Mts. Made a",
    "good shot with the",
    "rifle at a jackrabbit,",
    "cutting him nearly in",
    "two at about 75 yds."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "medium",
   "note": "Entry for 31 Aug 1884 per TR's heading. Compass abbreviation after struck \"before\" unclear; an \"E\" appears written above it."
